  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> Use a character's Wand of Magic Missiles charges to empower a friendly ranged spell attack with 1d4 Force damage. This requires an embedded item named exactly Wand of Magic Missiles with a usable system uses pool; if the item is absent or out of charges, the option cannot be used.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
